{"type":"message","id":"cd5292fb","parentId":"e9b879fe","timestamp":"2026-03-18T23:31:11.596Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我看到进程一直在等待二维码扫描，但似乎二维码没有被扫描，进程最后以 exit code 1 退出。从日志来看：\n\n1. 进程准备处理 BV1u61mBhEj7\n2. 生成了二维码：`QR_CODE_READY:C:\\Users\\LWS/.openclaw/workspace/bilibili_login_qr.png`\n3. 提示\"老大，请扫描这个二维码登录喵！🐾\"\n4. 但后续尝试读取字幕文件时都失败了，文件不存在\n5. 多次尝试后进程都以 exit code 1 退出\n\n这说明脚本在尝试获取视频信息时需要登录（可能是因为B站某些视频需要登录才能获取字幕），但是登录二维码没有被扫描，导致流程失败。\n\n我需要查看二维码图片是否存在，然后通知用户扫描二维码，或者看看是否有其他方式获取字幕（比如使用已有的cookie）。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我看到脚本需要B站登录才能下载字幕。让我检查一下二维码文件是否存在，并尝试使用不同的方法下载字幕："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:24","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\bilibili_login_qr.png","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:25","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\bilibili_cookie.txt"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773876657726}}
